mindmap
  root((STL Containers))
    Sequence Containers
      vector
        Dynamic array
        Random access O1
        Push_back amortized O1
      deque
        Double-ended queue
        Push/pop both ends
      list
        Doubly linked list
        O1 insert/delete anywhere
      forward_list C++11
        Singly linked list
        Minimal memory
      array C++11
        Fixed-size wrapper
        No dynamic allocation
      basic_string
        Char sequence container
    Associative Containers
      set
        Unique sorted keys
        Balanced BST typically
      multiset
        Duplicate keys allowed
      map
        Key-value pairs
        Unique sorted keys
      multimap
        Duplicate key-value
    Unordered Containers C++11
      unordered_set
        Hash table
        Average O1 operations
      unordered_multiset
        Duplicate hashed keys
      unordered_map
        Hash-based KV store
      unordered_multimap
        Duplicate hashed KV
    Container Adaptors
      stack LIFO
      queue FIFO
      priority_queue
        Max-heap by default
